## Model card

- **Name:** NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt E4B
- **Short description:** NVIDIA's 4-bit quantized variant of Nemotron 3.5 Bolt 74B-A9B, designed for even smaller memory footprint than the 24GB IQ2 variant. Open weights (OpenMDW-1.1).
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on HuggingFace (`nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-E4B` — gated/401); part of NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 family.
- **Release / knowledge:** Related to Nemotron 3.5 Bolt 74B-A9B (released 2026-10-15). E4B variant release date not published.
- **IDs:** `opencode/nemotron-3.5-bolt-e4b` (project ID); `nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-E4B` (HF, gated)
- **Context window:** 128K total (per `meta.json` — scaffolded; the 74B sibling supports 256K)
- **Modalities:** Text in/out (per `meta.json` — scaffolded)
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** Standard pricing (per `meta.json`); open weights available for self-hosting
- **Architecture:** 4-bit quantized variant of the 74B-A9B Mamba2-Transformer hybrid MoE

